  "At ANA and JAL in Japan it normally takes 10–15 years, with 5,000–8,000 flight hours or more required. Overseas carriers such as Emirates and Qatar Airways are expanding their route networks, so upgrade opportunities can arrive in 5–8 years. If early command is your goal, moving abroad is a serious option.": {"es":"En ANA y JAL, en Japón, normalmente toma 10–15 años y se requieren 5,000–8,000 horas de vuelo o más. Aerolíneas extranjeras como Emirates y Qatar Airways están ampliando sus redes de rutas, por lo que las oportunidades de ascenso a capitán pueden llegar en 5–8 años. Si tu objetivo es llegar pronto a capitán, irte al extranjero es una opción seria.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"flight-time-flight-hours:a387d6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "At ANA and JAL it typically takes 10–15 years as a First Officer to reach command, whereas at overseas carriers such as Emirates and Qatar Airways <g1>upgrade can come in as little as 5–8 years</g1>. Reaching the left seat while you are still young is one of the biggest attractions of moving abroad.": {"es":"En ANA y JAL normalmente se necesitan 10–15 años como primer oficial para llegar a capitán, mientras que en aerolíneas extranjeras como Emirates y Qatar Airways <g1>el ascenso puede llegar en apenas 5–8 años</g1>. Llegar al asiento izquierdo siendo todavía joven es uno de los mayores atractivos de irse al extranjero.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"first-officer:9237c8","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "At Aeromexico, the only airline we list in Mexico, our captain estimate averages <x1/> (<x2/>〜<x3/>) and first officers average <x4/> (<x5/>〜<x6/>). That is about 23% below the <x7/> captain average across the 115 airlines whose average pay we publish.": {"es":"En Aeromexico, la única aerolínea que listamos en México, nuestro estimado para capitán promedia <x1/> (<x2/>〜<x3/>) y el de primeros oficiales promedia <x4/> (<x5/>〜<x6/>). Eso es alrededor de un 23% menos que el promedio para capitán de <x7/> entre las 115 aerolíneas cuyo sueldo promedio publicamos.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/countries/mexico.html"]},
  "At Avianca, the only airline we list in Colombia, our captain estimate averages <x1/> (<x2/>〜<x3/>) and first officers average <x4/> (<x5/>〜<x6/>). That is about 43% below the <x7/> captain average across the 115 airlines whose average pay we publish.": {"es":"En Avianca, la única aerolínea que listamos en Colombia, nuestra estimación para capitán promedia <x1/> (<x2/>〜<x3/>) y la de primeros oficiales promedia <x4/> (<x5/>〜<x6/>). Eso está cerca de un 43% por debajo del promedio para capitán de <x7/> entre las 115 aerolíneas cuya remuneración promedio publicamos.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/countries/colombia.html"]},
  "At Copa Airlines, the only airline we list in Panama, our captain estimate averages <x1/> (<x2/>〜<x3/>) and first officers average <x4/> (<x5/>〜<x6/>). That is about 23% below the <x7/> captain average across the 115 airlines whose average pay we publish.": {"es":"En Copa Airlines, la única aerolínea que incluimos en Panamá, nuestra estimación para capitán promedia <x1/> (<x2/>〜<x3/>) y la de primer oficial promedia <x4/> (<x5/>〜<x6/>). Eso es alrededor de un 23% menos que el promedio para capitán de <x7/> en las 115 aerolíneas cuyo sueldo promedio publicamos.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/countries/panama.html"]},
  "At LATAM Airlines, the only airline we list in Chile, our captain estimate averages <x1/> (<x2/>〜<x3/>) and first officers average <x4/> (<x5/>〜<x6/>). That is about 36% below the <x7/> captain average across the 115 airlines whose average pay we publish.": {"es":"En LATAM Airlines, la única aerolínea que incluimos en Chile, nuestra estimación promedio para capitán es de <x1/> (<x2/>〜<x3/>) y la de primeros oficiales, de <x4/> (<x5/>〜<x6/>). Eso es alrededor de un 36% menos que el promedio para capitán de <x7/> entre las 115 aerolíneas cuyo sueldo promedio publicamos.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/countries/chile.html"]},
