  "Captain": {"es":"Capitán (Comandante)","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"captain:2afad0","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/profile.html"]},
  "Captain & First Officer — International operations. Madrid-based. Key requirements: License: EASA ATPL (AESA-issued); English: ICAO Level 4 or above. We have not been able to confirm flight-hour requirements the airline publishes; the airline’s careers page is linked under Jobs above.": {"es":"Capitán y primer oficial — Operaciones internacionales. Con base en Madrid. Requisitos principales: Licencia: ATPL EASA (emitida por AESA); inglés: nivel 4 OACI o superior. No hemos podido confirmar los requisitos de horas de vuelo que publica la aerolínea; la página de empleo de la aerolínea está enlazada en Empleos, más arriba.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/iberia.html"]},
  "Captain (CAP)": {"es":"Capitán / Comandante (CAP)","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"captain:2afad0","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "Captain / First Officer — Domestic and international operations. Bogotá-based. Key requirements: License: ATPL (AEROCIVIL / ICAO-compliant); English: ICAO Level 4 or above. We have not been able to confirm flight-hour requirements the airline publishes; the airline’s careers page is linked under Jobs above. Bogotá is a highland city. The climate is cool and comfortable, and the cost of living is low.": {"es":"Capitán / Primer oficial — Operaciones nacionales e internacionales. Con base en Bogotá. Requisitos principales: Licencia: ATPL (AEROCIVIL / conforme a OACI); Inglés: nivel 4 OACI o superior. No hemos podido confirmar los requisitos de horas de vuelo que publica la aerolínea; la página de empleo de la aerolínea está enlazada en Empleos, más arriba. Bogotá es una ciudad de altura. El clima es fresco y agradable, y el costo de vida es bajo.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/avianca.html"]},
  "Captain / First Officer — European routes. Barcelona / Madrid base. Key requirements: License: EASA ATPL (AESA-approved); English: ICAO Level 4 or above; Type Rating: A320 family preferred. We have not been able to confirm flight-hour requirements the airline publishes; the airline’s careers page is linked under Jobs above.": {"es":"Capitán / Primer oficial — rutas europeas. Base en Barcelona / Madrid. Requisitos principales: Licencia: ATPL EASA (aprobada por AESA); Inglés: nivel 4 de la OACI o superior; Habilitación de tipo: preferible familia A320. No hemos podido confirmar los requisitos de horas de vuelo que publica la aerolínea; la página de empleo de la aerolínea está enlazada más arriba, en Empleo.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8,type-rating:b7937e","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/vueling.html"]},
  "Captain / First Officer — International operations. Panama City base. Key requirements: License: ATPL (AAC / ICAO-compliant). Copa’s B737 captain vacancy asks for an ATP and a Class 1 medical, 5,000 hours total and 1,000 hours as pilot in command, and ICAO level 5 (based in Panama); its B737 first officer vacancy asks for 250 fixed-wing hours from Panamanian nationals and 1,000 from foreign nationals. Panama is Central America's financial and business hub. USD-denominated pay combined with a low cost of living is a key attraction.": {"es":"Capitán / Primer oficial — Operaciones internacionales. Base en Ciudad de Panamá. Requisitos principales: Licencia: ATPL (AAC / conforme a OACI). La vacante de capitán B737 de Copa pide ATP y certificado médico clase 1, 5,000 horas totales y 1,000 horas como piloto al mando, y nivel 5 OACI (con base en Panamá); su vacante de primer oficial B737 pide 250 horas en ala fija a nacionales panameños y 1,000 a extranjeros. Panamá es el centro financiero y de negocios de Centroamérica. La remuneración en USD, combinada con un bajo costo de vida, es uno de los principales atractivos.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8,pay-salary:4d4435,pilot-in-command:b992be,pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/copa-airlines.html"]},
  "Captain / First Officer — International operations. Santiago / São Paulo based. Key requirements: License: ATPL (ICAO-compliant, certified by the relevant national authority); English: ICAO Level 4 or above. We have not been able to confirm flight-hour requirements the airline publishes.": {"es":"Capitán / Primer oficial — Operaciones internacionales. Con base en Santiago / São Paulo. Requisitos principales: Licencia: ATPL (conforme a OACI, certificada por la autoridad nacional correspondiente); Inglés: nivel 4 OACI o superior. No hemos podido confirmar los requisitos de horas de vuelo que publica la aerolínea.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/latam.html"]},
  "Captain / First Officer — International route flying. Mexico City base. Key requirements: License Required: ATPL (AFAC / ICAO compliant); English: ICAO Level 4 or above. We have not been able to confirm flight-hour requirements the airline publishes. The partnership with Delta Air Lines brings a large number of codeshare routes. Mexico City is Latin America's business hub.": {"es":"Capitán / Primer oficial — Vuelos en rutas internacionales. Base en Ciudad de México. Requisitos principales: licencia requerida: ATPL (conforme a AFAC / OACI); inglés: nivel 4 OACI o superior. No hemos podido confirmar los requisitos de horas de vuelo que publica la aerolínea. La alianza con Delta Air Lines aporta un gran número de rutas en código compartido. Ciudad de México es el centro de negocios de América Latina.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":1,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,first-officer:9237c8","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/aeromexico.html"]},
