  "Flying is one of the highest-paying professions in Japan. Pay varies widely by airline, rank, aircraft type and years of experience, but as of 2026 the benchmarks look like this.": {"es":"Ser piloto es una de las profesiones mejor pagadas de Japón. El sueldo varía mucho según la aerolínea, la categoría, el tipo de aeronave y los años de experiencia, pero en 2026 las cifras de referencia son las siguientes.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"aircraft-type:6b391c,airline:8a75a5,pay-salary:4d4435,rank-position-allowance:cd97f1,rank-position:a04160","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "For a bus the company runs for crew or staff. Select all that apply. If there is no restriction, choose only \"No restriction\".": {"es":"Aplica al autobús que opera la empresa para la tripulación o el personal. Selecciona todas las opciones que correspondan. Si no hay restricción, elige solo \"Sin restricción\".","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
  "For a bus the company runs for crew or staff: whether the company covers the whole cost, or you pay some of it.": {"es":"Aplica al autobús que opera la empresa para la tripulación o el personal: si la empresa cubre el costo total o si pagas una parte.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
  "For company-sponsored cadets, the airline covers the entire cost once you are hired (<x1/>–<x2/>). The Civil Aviation College is state-run and relatively affordable (tuition of <x3/>–<x4/>). Self-funded training at an overseas flight school requires roughly <x5/>–<x6/>. The cadet route carries by far the lowest financial risk, but competition for places is intense.": {"es":"Para los pilotos en formación patrocinados por la aerolínea, la aerolínea cubre todo el costo una vez que te contratan (<x1/>–<x2/>). La Escuela de Aviación Civil (Civil Aviation College) es estatal y relativamente económica (matrícula de <x3/>–<x4/>). La formación autofinanciada en una escuela de vuelo en el extranjero requiere aprox. <x5/>–<x6/>. La ruta de piloto en formación patrocinado conlleva, por mucho, el menor riesgo financiero, pero la competencia por las plazas es intensa.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,cadet-trainee-pilot:67402b","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "For taxis the company arranges, and rides you pay for and claim back. Select all that apply. If there is no restriction, choose only \"No restriction\".": {"es":"Aplica a los taxis que gestiona la empresa y a los trayectos que pagas tú y luego pides que te reembolsen. Selecciona todas las opciones que correspondan. Si no hay restricción, elige solo \"Sin restricción\".","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
  "For taxis the company arranges, and rides you pay for and claim back: whether it covers the whole way between home and the airport, only a set distance or area, or only as far as a set point.": {"es":"Aplica a los taxis que gestiona la empresa y a los trayectos que pagas tú y luego pides que te reembolsen: si cubre todo el trayecto entre tu casa y el aeropuerto, solo una distancia o zona establecida, o solo hasta un punto establecido.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435,standby:08030a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
  "For taxis the company arranges, and rides you pay for and claim back: whether the company covers the whole cost, or you pay some of it.": {"es":"Aplica a los taxis que gestiona la empresa y a los trayectos que pagas tú y luego pides que te reembolsen: si la empresa cubre el costo total o si pagas una parte.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
  "For taxis the company arranges, and rides you pay for and claim back: whether there is a limit on what the company covers. If you can, give the amount in the note.": {"es":"Aplica a los taxis que gestiona la empresa y a los trayectos que pagas tú y luego pides que te reembolsen: si hay un tope en lo que cubre la empresa. Si puedes, indica el monto en la nota.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
  "For these 1 the figures are our own estimates with a range, worked out from publicly available information.": {"es":"Para estas aerolíneas (1), las cifras son nuestras propias estimaciones con un rango, calculadas a partir de información disponible públicamente.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/countries/spain.html"]},
  "For tickets where the seat is held in advance: whether you pay a fare, or only taxes and airport charges.": {"es":"En los boletos con los que el asiento se aparta con anticipación: si pagas una tarifa o solo impuestos y cargos aeroportuarios.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435,standby:08030a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
  "For tickets where you wait for a free seat: whether you pay a fare, or only taxes and airport charges.": {"es":"En los boletos con los que esperas a que haya un asiento libre: si pagas una tarifa o solo impuestos y cargos aeroportuarios.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435,standby:08030a","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
