  "Iberia pilot salary 2026: we estimate $174K for captains ($135K–$250K) and $87K for first officers ($63K–$133K). Fleet, hiring requirements and pilot reviews.": {"es":"Sueldo de pilotos de Iberia 2026: estimamos $174 mil para capitanes ($135 mil–$250 mil) y $87 mil para primeros oficiales ($63 mil–$133 mil). Flota, requisitos de contratación y reseñas de pilotos.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"fleet:56d21e,pay-salary:4d4435,pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/iberia.html"]},
  "Iberia pilots’ collective agreement (10th). Taken as 30 consecutive days or split, for example into two blocks of 15 · 28 December 2022": {"es":"Convenio colectivo de los pilotos de Iberia (10.º). Se toman 30 días consecutivos o fraccionados, por ejemplo en dos bloques de 15 · 28 de diciembre de 2022","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"collective-agreement:c266c0","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/iberia.html"]},
