  "The 115 airlines we track, grouped by the country they are based in. Open a country for its airline-by-airline breakdown. 0 countries carry no country average, because we are part-way through tracing each airline's figures — the per-airline figures are on those pages.": {"es":"Las 115 aerolíneas que seguimos, agrupadas por el país donde tienen su sede. Abre un país para ver el desglose aerolínea por aerolínea. 0 países no tienen promedio por país porque aún estamos rastreando el origen de las cifras de cada aerolínea; las cifras de cada aerolínea están en esas páginas.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/countries.html"]},
  "The 2025 vacancy for new-entry pilots is no longer available": {"es":"La vacante 2025 para pilotos de nuevo ingreso ya no está disponible","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/iberia.html"]},
  "The 52 of our 52 countries that carry a country average.": {"es":"Los 52 de nuestros 52 países que tienen un promedio por país.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/countries.html"]},
  "The <g1>company-sponsored cadet selection</g1> run each year by ANA, JAL, Peach and others is a program in which the airline covers the full cost of training (<x2/>–<x3/>) once you are hired. Applications are open to arts and science graduates alike, provided you hold a university degree and meet the vision and medical standards. Competition can exceed 100 applicants per place, so it is a narrow gate — but it is the lowest-risk route there is.": {"es":"La <g1>selección de pilotos en formación patrocinados por la aerolínea</g1> que realizan cada año ANA, JAL, Peach y otras es un programa en el que la aerolínea cubre el costo total de la formación (<x2/>–<x3/>) una vez que te contratan. Pueden postularse egresados de humanidades y de ciencias por igual, siempre que tengan título universitario y cumplan los requisitos de visión y médicos. La competencia puede superar los 100 aspirantes por plaza, así que es una puerta estrecha, pero es la ruta de menor riesgo que existe.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,cadet-trainee-pilot:67402b","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "The <g1>gross</g1>, before tax and deductions (“Gross Pay” on your payslip). Bonuses go in <g2>Annual bonus</g2> below.": {"es":"El monto <g1>bruto</g1>, antes de impuestos y deducciones (“Gross Pay” en tu recibo de nómina). Los bonos van en <g2>Bono anual</g2>, más abajo.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"annual-bonus:b192eb,deductions:5a7943,gross-pay:acca3d,pay-salary:4d4435,payslip:c09b58","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "The <g1>monthly total of per diem</g1>. Enter <g2>0</g2> if none was paid, or your airline pays none.": {"es":"El <g1>total mensual de viáticos</g1>. Ingresa <g2>0</g2> si no te pagaron viáticos o si tu aerolínea no los paga.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,per-diem:8854c2","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
