  "The Office does not warrant the accuracy or safety of the content of any external site linked from the Service.": {"es":"La Oficina no garantiza la exactitud ni la seguridad del contenido de ningún sitio externo enlazado desde el Servicio.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/terms.html"]},
  "The Office may amend these Terms without obtaining the consent of Users where it deems such amendment necessary. The amended Terms take effect from the time they are posted on the Service, and a User who uses the Service after the amendment shall be deemed to have agreed to it.": {"es":"La Oficina podrá modificar estos Términos sin obtener el consentimiento de los Usuarios cuando lo considere necesario. Los Términos modificados entrarán en vigor desde el momento en que se publiquen en el Servicio, y se considerará que todo Usuario que utilice el Servicio después de la modificación la ha aceptado.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/terms.html"]},
  "The Office may interrupt, suspend or terminate the Service without prior notice for reasons including system maintenance, inspection or disaster.": {"es":"La Oficina podrá interrumpir, suspender o dar por terminado el Servicio sin previo aviso por motivos que incluyen el mantenimiento o la inspección del sistema, o desastres.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/terms.html"]},
  "The Office may provide paid services within the Service, or may make part of the Service chargeable in the future.": {"es":"La Oficina podrá ofrecer servicios de pago dentro del Servicio o hacer de pago una parte del Servicio en el futuro.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/terms.html"]},
  "The Office reviews the content of submitted reports and may, without prior notice, withhold publication of, delete, or partially amend any report it determines to be inappropriate.": {"es":"La Oficina revisa el contenido de los informes enviados y podrá, sin previo aviso, suspender la publicación, eliminar o modificar parcialmente cualquier informe que considere inapropiado.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/terms.html"]},
  "The amount paid per day on domestic trips. If it is paid by the hour, a rough daily figure is fine.": {"es":"El monto que se paga por día en viajes nacionales. Si se paga por hora, basta con una cifra diaria aproximada.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
  "The amount paid per day on international trips. If it varies by destination, use the one you fly to most.": {"es":"El monto que se paga por día en viajes internacionales. Si varía según el destino, usa el del destino al que más vuelas.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
  "The breakdown (<g1></g1>) adds up to more than the gross pay above (<g2></g2>). Please check one of the two.": {"es":"El desglose (<g1></g1>) suma más que el sueldo bruto de arriba (<g2></g2>). Revisa una de las dos cifras.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"gross-pay:acca3d,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "The carriers recruiting internationally most actively are <g1>Emirates, Qatar Airways, Singapore Airlines and Cathay Pacific</g1>. Emirates quotes a direct-entry Captain: <x2/> in cash a year, with a total package worth <x3/> (both tax-free). Cathay Pacific gives First Officers a target of <x4/> a year, which is a target and not a guarantee, and we estimate Cathay Pacific Captains at about <x5/>. We estimate Qatar Airways Captains at about <x6/> and Singapore Airlines Captains at about <x7/>, from public information.<x8/><x9/> Middle Eastern and Asian carriers are hiring internationally, and you can apply with an ATPL, the required flight time (typically 1,500–2,500 hours or more) and English proficiency (ICAO Level 4 or above). Benefits are generous too, including housing allowance, medical cover and staff travel. <g10>See pay at overseas airlines →</g10>": {"es":"Las aerolíneas que más activamente contratan a nivel internacional son <g1>Emirates, Qatar Airways, Singapore Airlines y Cathay Pacific</g1>. Emirates indica para un capitán de ingreso directo: <x2/> al año en efectivo, con un paquete total equivalente a <x3/> (ambos libres de impuestos). Cathay Pacific ofrece a los primeros oficiales una remuneración objetivo de <x4/> al año, que es un objetivo y no una garantía, y estimamos que los capitanes de Cathay Pacific ganan alrededor de <x5/>. Estimamos que los capitanes de Qatar Airways ganan alrededor de <x6/> y los de Singapore Airlines, alrededor de <x7/>, a partir de información pública.<x8/><x9/> Las aerolíneas de Medio Oriente y Asia contratan a nivel internacional, y puedes postularte con una ATPL, las horas de vuelo requeridas (normalmente 1,500–2,500 horas o más) y dominio del inglés (nivel 4 de la OACI o superior). Las prestaciones también son generosas e incluyen ayuda para vivienda, seguro médico y pases de viaje para empleados. <g10>Ver la remuneración en aerolíneas extranjeras →</g10>","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline-transport-pilot-licence:c922e1,allowance:8e7744,captain:2afad0,flight-time-flight-hours:a387d6,housing-allowance:d1b715,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/index.html"]},
  "The city and skyscrapers beyond the dome of the Palace of Fine Arts (San Francisco)": {"es":"La ciudad y los rascacielos detrás de la cúpula del Palacio de Bellas Artes (San Francisco)","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/copa-airlines.html"]},
  "The company pays 30% of each dependant’s premium (40% from December 2026)": {"es":"La empresa paga el 30% de la prima del seguro de cada dependiente (40% a partir de diciembre de 2026)","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"supplement-premium:c7fbe6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/latam.html"]},
