  "The content must not infringe the copyright, reputation, privacy or other rights of any third party.": {"es":"El contenido no debe infringir los derechos de autor, la reputación, la privacidad ni ningún otro derecho de terceros.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/terms.html"]},
