  "The contractual floor you are paid <g1>even if you do not fly it</g1> (Minimum Guarantee). Leave it blank if your contract has none.": {"es":"El mínimo de horas por contrato que se te pagan <g1>aunque no las vueles</g1> (mínimo garantizado). Déjalo en blanco si tu contrato no lo tiene.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":1,"gl":"contract:1ddc3a,minimum-guarantee:eb8c84","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pay-report.html"]},
  "The data shown is for reference only. Always check each airline's own recruitment page for current information.": {"es":"Los datos mostrados son solo de referencia. Consulta siempre la página de reclutamiento de cada aerolínea para obtener información actualizada.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/index.html"]},
