  "The figures, hours and airline you submit. <g1>They are stored without being linked to who submitted them</g1> (we keep an irreversible hash rather than your account ID, purely to detect duplicate submissions). Used to produce aggregate statistics.": {"es":"Las cifras, horas y aerolínea que envías. <g1>Se guardan sin vincularse a quien las envió</g1> (conservamos un hash irreversible en lugar del ID de tu cuenta, únicamente para detectar envíos duplicados). Se usan para generar estadísticas agregadas.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,submit:a480e6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/personal-data.html"]},
  "The full amount at the time of joining is fine.": {"es":"Basta con el monto total al momento de ingresar.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
  "The global pilot shortage is deepening and pay is on an upward trend. Boeing and Airbus forecast a need for more than 600,000 pilots worldwide by 2040. Competition for crews is especially fierce in the growth markets of the Middle East and Asia, where terms continue to improve. In Japan, ANA and JAL both implemented pay rises between 2023 and 2025.": {"es":"La escasez mundial de pilotos se está agudizando y los sueldos muestran una tendencia al alza. Boeing y Airbus prevén que se necesitarán más de 600,000 pilotos en todo el mundo para 2040. La competencia por tripulaciones es especialmente intensa en los mercados en crecimiento de Medio Oriente y Asia, donde las condiciones siguen mejorando. En Japón, tanto ANA como JAL aplicaron aumentos salariales entre 2023 y 2025.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"pay-salary:4d4435,pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
  "The handling of personal information obtained by the Office in connection with use of the Service shall be governed by the separately established \"<g1>Privacy Policy</g1>\".": {"es":"El tratamiento de la información personal que obtenga la Oficina en relación con el uso del Servicio se regirá por la \"<g1>Política de privacidad</g1>\" establecida por separado.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/terms.html"]},
  "The internal seniority list that drives upgrade, fleet choice and bidding.": {"es":"El escalafón interno que determina el ascenso a capitán, la elección de flota y las solicitudes de programación (bidding).","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"fleet:56d21e,seniority-list:50a788,seniority:b57888","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
  "The minimum number of years since joining that the company sets to be eligible.": {"es":"El número mínimo de años desde el ingreso que fija la empresa para ser elegible.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["pv-conditions.json"]},
