  "The pay the company itself states is the starting monthly figure for its own cadet trainees.": {"es":"La remuneración que publica la propia aerolínea es el sueldo mensual inicial de sus pilotos en formación patrocinados.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"cadet-trainee-pilot:67402b,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/pilot-salary-guide.html"]},
