  "Users represent and warrant that they are not, and will not in the future become, a member of an organized crime group or any other anti-social force. If it becomes clear that this is not the case, the Office may immediately suspend that User's use of the Service.": {"es":"Los Usuarios declaran y garantizan que no son, ni serán en el futuro, miembros de un grupo del crimen organizado ni de ninguna otra fuerza antisocial. Si se determina que no es así, la Oficina podrá suspender de inmediato el uso del Servicio por parte de dicho Usuario.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/terms.html"]},
  "Users shall post reports in good faith, based on their own first-hand experience as a pilot.": {"es":"Los Usuarios deberán publicar los informes de buena fe, con base en su propia experiencia directa como pilotos.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"pilot:543af6","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/terms.html"]},
  "Using the Service for commercial purposes, to obstruct the recruitment activities of a third party, or to improperly harvest information.": {"es":"Utilizar el Servicio con fines comerciales, para obstaculizar las actividades de reclutamiento de terceros o para recopilar información de forma indebida.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":3,"gl":"","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/terms.html"]},
