  "Vueling Airlines captain pay is estimated at about <x1/> per year, pre-tax. These are our own estimates from public information, not figures the airline publishes.": {"es":"Se estima que un capitán de Vueling Airlines gana unos <x1/> al año, antes de impuestos. Son estimaciones propias a partir de información pública, no cifras que publique la aerolínea.","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"airline:8a75a5,captain:2afad0,pay-salary:4d4435","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["en/airlines/vueling.html"]},
