  "js:'※ These are picked up from the order of your own records. Nothing here is confirmed as a move or a promotion — they are markers, so you can compare the real amounts either side.'": {"es":"js:'※ Se detectan a partir del orden de tus propios registros. Nada de esto está confirmado como un cambio o un ascenso: son marcadores para que puedas comparar los montos reales antes y después.'","st":"validated","by":"ai","model":"claude-opus-5-5","pv":4,"gl":"compare:0740b9","at":"2026-11-02","pages":["my-value.js"]},
